/target
# Leading slash matters: an unanchored `data/` also matches `tests/data/`, which would
# exclude the two fixtures that `src/lib.rs` and `tests/api.rs` both `include!`.
/data/
/models/
*.model
*.vocab
# bench.py imports train_comparators.py, so Python caches bytecode next to it.
__pycache__/
# Step reports are analysis of the tokenizer, not part of how it works. Kept in the
# working tree, deliberately never pushed.
*_REPORT.md
# Run folders from scripts/train_tokenizer.py: trained tokenizers, logs and run records.
# Outputs of the code, not part of it.
/runs/
